{"name":"-57-1-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Moon","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After a long and busy day, you decide to go for a walk in the forest park which you still haven't been to. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In your time, tall trees are a rarity due to ELID infections. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yet in this park, there are apparently a handful of trees that are over a century old."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I wonder, what do people in this era feel as they gaze up at these massive trees?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With your hands clasped behind your back, you stand beneath the lush foliage and peer up at the trees that almost seem to touch the sky."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_wind_grass","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The leaves rustle softly in the cool evening breeze, and you occasionally catch a floral aroma in the air. You close your eyes contently as you bask in this bubble of tranquility."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh! Something jumps out of the trees. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Probably a squirrel? In your time, these woodland critters are also extremely rare. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But here in Saga Forest Park, squirrels are still nesting safely in the trees."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A squirrel taps you lightly on the face. You can't help but smile. Is this the happiness of being connected with nature?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, stop grinning like an idiot."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The squirrel speaks."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait, the squirrel SPEAKS?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"openEyes","raw":"睁眼"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_20HW_Scene_BPM82_loop","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good evening."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A man in a black ninja suit is hanging upside down from a branch less than 10cm away from your face."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=2%%delay=0.1%%range=8","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Before you can let out a startled cry, the ninja has already clamped a hand over your mouth and jumped down nimbly from the tree."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"pre