ange ninja's words are still echoing inside your head as you make your way back to your room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"The mightiest power of the era.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"Honed and protected with utmost care.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"When Franchouchou's light shines upon every corner of this era.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Young girls are destined to change the world in every universe, huh."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You look out at the darkness of the night outside the window and let out a sigh."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
